# Project Overview

Expo SDK 54 / React Native 0.81 / TypeScript (strict) mosque app: prayer times, Qibla, Stripe donations, events, FCM.

## Layout

- `app/` — Expo Router screens (file-based); tabs in `app/(tabs)/`
- `components/` — reusable UI; `components/ui/` for generics
- `hooks/` — business logic; `services/` — Firebase/API; `types/` — shared types
- `constants/` — theme, channels, configs
- `android/` — **committed native project** — do not gitignore; avoid edits unless required
- `firebase.ts` — App Check, Firestore, regional Functions (`australia-southeast1`)
- `index.js` — entry; FCM background handlers must register **before** app loads

## Path alias

`@/*` maps to project root (`tsconfig.json`).

## Hard constraints

- No test frameworks unless explicitly requested (manual device/Expo Go testing)
- Prefer Expo packages over bare RN alternatives; minimize new deps (SDK 54 compatible)
- No Redux/MobX — hooks + local state
- Do not reorder `index.js` imports or casually change `metro.config.js` / `firebase.ts` / `eas.json` / `app.json`
